    "description": "Self-indicating, mains or DC-powered indicators designed to be used as part of Class III or IIII non-automatic weighing instruments. Desktop and wall-mounted versions. Devices include initial, semi-automatic and automatic zero setting, zero tracking, semi-automatic subtractive tare, preset tare, MPP alibi storage device, up to 2 load receptors, load receptor summation, weighbridge modes (AdR/RDA, RcD, RpD/RCP), identification of A/D converters, digital load cells and DILINK junction boxes, and encrypted weight data transmission in open networks or wireless transmission in protected mode per Welmec 7.2. Interfaces: 6-wire shielded load cell connection (analogue/digital), RS232/422/485, Ethernet, Wi-Fi (internal antenna), 0-10 V / 0-20 mA analogue input/output, digital I/O, field bus (Profibus), USB host, SD card, audio. Sealing by physical protected switch or password-protected software sealing with non-resettable SW seal counter."
